 "notes": {
  "196:4916": "alarm also means sudden fear; the girl is visibly scared on the rope bridge",
  "444:1452": "tropical storm among palm trees implies a hot place; arguable",
  "444:1425": "tropical setting implies heat; heat lightning association; arguable",
  "5452:1860": "man wrapped in a blanket slowly sipping from a mug in still morning mist could read as sleepy",
  "4298:1200": "a school PE class in a gym; course as a series of lessons is arguably what is shown",
  "5283:1624": "huge stack of colourful plates and a bright patchwork shirt; orange is very likely visible",
  "5283:2176": "colourful plates and patchwork shirt; yellow is very likely visible",
  "5283:1393": "colourful plates and patchwork shirt; green is very likely visible",
  "4221:5248": "lizard settles in the dark and tucks a blanket around itself; could be read as going to bed, though it eats and watches TV on a couch",
  "4220:5458": "bare word pants = trousers in everyday use; the man shown is wearing them",
  "4503:6014": "a birthday cake is the centre of the scene and cake is sweet; the hugging friends are also sweet",
  "5644:434": "gear also means equipment; ladder, roller, paint tins and tray are the painting gear on screen",
  "4360:370": "woman in a striking patterned dress showing off leather handbags; elegant is arguable",
  "4217:1918": "a police car chasing a runaway kart implies a theft / stolen kart to many viewers",
  "6929:434": "gear also means equipment; leather apron, gloves, tongs and hammer are the workers gear"
 }
